  > 3 │   <p>{{ double() }}</p>
      │         ^^^^^^^^
    4 │   <p>{{ label() }}</p>
    5 │ </template>
  
  i Vue gives you the value that the getter of a computed property returns. Calling a value that is not a function throws an error when the code runs.
  
